<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id" />
  <para style="h">II Jean</para>
  <para style="toc1">DEZYÈM LÈT JEAN</para>
  <para style="toc2">II Jean</para>
  <para style="toc3">II Jn</para>
  <para style="mt1">DEZYÈM LÈT JEAN</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Ansyen an k ap ekri madanm chwazi a, ansanm ak pitit li yo, ke mwen renmen anverite; pa mwen sèlman, men tout sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:32">Jn 8:32</ref></char></note>konnen laverite yo, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />pou koz laverite a, ki rete nan nou, e ki va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:16">Jn 14:16</ref></char></note>avèk nou jis pou tout tan: <verse eid="2JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Wo 1:17</ref></char></note>Lagras, mizerikòd, ak lapè va avèk nou, ki sòti nan Bondye, Papa a, ak Senyè a Jésus Kri, Fis a Papa a, nan verite, ak nan lamou.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 3:3">Jn 3:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mwen te tèlman kontan pou twouve kèk nan timoun ou yo ki t ap mache nan laverite a, jis jan ke Papa a te kòmande nou fè a.<verse eid="2JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Konsa, koulye a mwen mande ou, madanm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:7">I Jn 2:7</ref></char></note>pa tankou mwen t ap ekri yon kòmandman tounèf, men menm sila ke nou te gen depi nan kòmansman an, pou nou renmen youn lòt. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:3">I Jn 5:3</ref></char></note>sa se lanmou, pou nou mache selon kòmandman Li yo. Sa se kòmandman an, jis jan ke ou te tande li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:7">I Jn 2:7</ref></char></note>depi nan kòmansman an, pou ou ta mache nan li.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:26">I Jn 2:26</ref></char></note>anpil sediktè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:19">I Jn 2:19</ref></char></note>gen tan antre nan mond lan, sa yo ki pa rekonèt ke Jésus Kri te vini nan lachè a. Sila a se sediktè a, ak antikris la.<verse eid="2JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Veye nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:8">I Kor 3:8</ref></char></note>pou nou pa pèdi sa ke nou gen tan fin reyalize a, men pou nou resevwa tout rekonpans lan.<verse eid="2JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Nenpòt moun ki fin ale byen lwen e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:16">Jn 7:16</ref></char></note>pa kontinye nan doktrin Kris la, pa gen Bondye. Sila ki rete nan doktrin nan, li gen ni Papa a, ni Fis la.<verse eid="2JN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Si nenpòt moun vini a nou, ki pa pote doktrin sila a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:16">I Wa 13:16</ref></char></note>pa resevwa li nan kay nou, e pa menm salye li, <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />paske sila ki salye li a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:11">Ef 5:11</ref></char></note>patisipe nan zak malveyan li yo.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="3JN 1:13">III Jn 13</ref>,<ref loc="3JN 1:14">14</ref></char>
    </note>Malgre ke mwen gen anpil bagay pou m ta ekri nou, mwen pa vle fè sa avèk papye ak lank; men mwen espere ke m va vini a nou menm pou nou pale fasafas, jis pou jwa nou kapab vin akonpli.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Pitit a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2JN 1:1">II Jn 1</ref></char></note>sè chwazi yo salye nou. Amen<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>